List resolved Strap artifact layers.

Usage:
  strap layers
  strap layers list
  strap layers roots <command|tool|agent|skill|model>

`STRAP_PATH` is a colon-separated list of layer roots. Entries may be
unnamed paths or named entries in `name=/path` form. The runner normalizes it
and appends implicit named layers such as user, project, global, and root when
they are not explicitly supplied.
